<title>NORWAY: Statoil's 1996 net profits steady.</title>
<headline>Statoil's 1996 net profits steady.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31.</p>
<p>				(billions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>Operating income	     107.1	  vs     86.5</p>
<p>Operating profit		18.2	  vs     13.6</p>
<p>Pre-tax profits		 17.9	  vs     14.7</p>
<p>Tax				 12.6	  vs	9.4</p>
<p>After-tax profits		5.3	  vs	5.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian state-owned oil, gas and petrochemicals company is Den norske stats oljeselskap AS (Statoil).</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
